{"id": "27473", "title": "龙吟九天", "author": "一厢情愿", "category": "其他类型", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/27/27473.htm", "intro": "一位立志振兴中华的年青科学家龙吟,在一次实验中回到了八百年前,他用自己的知识与智慧统一了中国,实现了自己振兴中华的壮志!\r\n　　    正是：一夜梦回八百年，正万里烽烟，\r\n　　　　神州北望，山河破碎，几时能圆？\r\n　　　　腾龙旗染英雄血，血色分外鲜，\r\n　　　　诸君看我，光耀华夏，龙吟九天！            授权信息：驻站作品  类别：奇幻  本月点击数：12 次  本月支持票：0 张 [投票支持]   写作进度：连载  字数：153146  点击总次数：27626 次  读者支持票：679 张  读者收藏数：19", "base": "files/article/html/27/27473", "chapters": [{"title": "第一卷", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "1841127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "1841128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "1841129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "1841131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "1841134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章 军名腾龙", "file": "1841137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章 方略初定", "file": "1841140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "1841143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "1841145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "1841147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "1841149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "1841153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "1841156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "1841160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "1841162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "1841166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "1841168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "1841170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "1841172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "1841175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "1841177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "1841181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "1841182.html", "available": false}, {"